%N A130003 a(n) is the smallest positive integer m such that 4^k + m is prime for all k=1,2,...,n.
%H A130003 Jacob Glickman, <a href="https://github.com/jhg023/first-knowns">first-knowns: exhaustive search for A130003</a>, GitHub, 2026.
